1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:12,643
This is the classic example of magical realism: impossible events told in exactly the same calm tone as ordinary ones, so the magic feels like part of everyday life.

2
00:00:12,643 --> 00:00:19,023
The narrator never explains it, and the characters soon find it a nuisance rather than a marvel.

3
00:00:19,023 --> 00:00:24,830
An angel arrives, and he smells of the outdoors and is fed eggplant mush.

